%%% note
gRPC コネクタ (mule-grpc-connector 1.0.4) のクライアントの単項の呼び出し (grpc:unary-call)。相手は mule-oracle の gRPC のスタブで、
メソッドごとに決まった応答 (成功、失敗の status、Trailers-Only、protobuf として読めない本文、trailer 無しなど) を返す。
スタブの Garbage (枠の壊れた本文)・Http503・Empty (メッセージ無しの成功) は、実 Mule が応答を返さずに止まるので記録しない
(mulay の扱いは docs/compat/deviations.md)。
%%% port 18291
%%% grpcserver 18290
%%% request GET /c/echo
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "p": {
    "message": "Zed",
    "n": 3,
    "tags": "m",
    "tags": "n"
  },
  "attrs": null
}
%%% request GET /c/echo-direct
%%% response 500
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Could not serialize object
%%% request GET /c/meta
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "t": "Object",
  "mediaType": "*/*; charset=UTF-8",
  "mimeType": "*/*",
  "cls": "org.mule.runtime.api.metadata.TypedValue",
  "raw": {
    "message": "",
    "n": 0
  },
  "enc": "UTF-8",
  "len": null
}
%%% request GET /c/headers
%%% response 200
content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

:authority: localhost:18290
:method: POST
:path: /stub.S/Headers
:scheme: http
accept: */*
content-length: 18
content-type: application/grpc
te: trailers
user-agent: Mule HTTP Client
x-conn: c1
x-trace: op-1
x-upper: Up
%%% request GET /c/fail
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "GRPC:NOT_FOUND",
  "description": "gRPC operation 'UNARY' failed with status NOT_FOUND: nicht gefunden: ü 100%\nMethod: stub.S/Fail"
}
%%% request GET /c/trailers-only
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "GRPC:PERMISSION_DENIED",
  "description": "gRPC operation 'UNARY' failed with status PERMISSION_DENIED: denied\nMethod: stub.S/TrailersOnly"
}
