  "description": "\"While parsing a protocol message, the input ended unexpectedly in the middle of a field.  This could mean either that the input has been truncated or that an embedded message misreported its own length.\nTrace:\n  at main (Unknown), while reading `payload` as ProtoBuf.\nTrace:\n  at main (Unknown)\" evaluating expression: \"output application/json --- {p: payload, attrs: attributes default null}\"."
}
